				"⣿⣿⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				11
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Replace Electron IPC with Tauri IPC across Sky and Wind\n\nCoordinate eight Land submodules to replace Electron's ipcMain protocol with native Tauri invoke:\n\n- **Sky**: Add Step 7 build hook in astro.config.ts that replaces VS Code's ElectronIPCMainProcessService with TauriMainProcessService at build time. Routes all IPC channel.call() invocations through Tauri invoke to Mountain's WindServiceHandlers.\n\n- **Wind**: Implement two parallel IPC pathways: (1) IPCRendererShim binary protocol loopback - re-implements VS Code's binary IPC serialization for vscode:message events with loopback responses, with stub handlers to prevent workbench hangs; (2) TauriMainProcessService - drop-in replacement routing through Tauri invoke, eliminating binary protocol overhead.\n\n- **Wind**: Extend ResolveConfiguration with full INativeWindowConfiguration including profiles, colorScheme, accessibilitySupport, and other DesktopMain fields. Fix appRoot to strip origin and set VSCODE_DEV: \"true\" for relative imports.\n\n- **Echo**: Bump miniflare (4.20260401.0 → 4.20260405.0), @cloudflare/workers-types (4.20260405.1 → 4.20260408.1), wrangler (4.80.0 → 4.81.0).\n\n- **Sky**: Bump vite (8.0.5 → 8.0.7), @playform/compress (0.2.2 → 0.2.3).\n\n- **Cocoon**: Bump vitest (4.1.2 → 4.1.3), @vitest/coverage-v8 (4.1.2 → 4.1.3); style ESBuild config formatting.\n\nThis completes the Electron→Tauri migration enabling VS Code workbench to initialize in Tauri's WKWebView.",
			"SHA": "eb26f83991506ff10c8ba79a30a4197983b27bef"
		}
